                        Feature exerciser — Mermaid                                                                     
                        ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━                        
                                                                                                                        
                        All seven families, each exercising the syntax the README claims to                             
                        support, each small enough that its box art can be read as a diff. Wide                         
                        and degenerate cases are at the end.                                                            
                                                                                                                        
